Firefly Pointillism demo · 《你亮，我就亮》 Shine Back · third-party assets and sources

## Voice
- Kokoro-82M (hexgrad), voice af_bella, Apache License 2.0; run locally via kokoro-onnx (MIT) through the
  library's core/tts/tts.py. Speech check: faster-whisper base.en (MIT; OpenAI Whisper weights, MIT).
  Script: demo/vo/lines.json. The clips (demo/vo/wav/*.wav) stay local and are regenerated by build.sh.

## Music samples (CC0; credit not required, given with thanks)
- VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios),
  FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org)
  Instruments: harp, glockenspiel, hand_chimes, glass, vibraphone, vibraphone_bowed, flute, horn, cellos, cellos_pizz,
  violas, violins, violins_trem, violins_pizz, contrabass, timpani, sus_cymbal (core/audio/sampler.py).
- Crickets, wind, rain and the whoosh of the particle flows are procedural (core/audio/sfx.py and demo/mix.py).

